{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214fdcccde98d0a62775f2877532a682dd0c57a52cd14611dc528e8ff823d3ea",
      "text": "软弱与逞强都要同行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ee0d161c3b102aacf450b3ff5759730997bc335648bad12290e9d72bc04767",
      "text": "もふもふえん决定参加男极“演技部门”。\n为了饰演三兄弟王子的角色，他们和前来提供\n协助的C.FIRST一起努力训练。\n然而，接二连三的剧本修改\n让他们开始心生不安……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000030:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010eb00a2742ee87f352d94f38fb9c43e26548a2aea7d644d19daab1f3b3e4bc",
      "text": "第6话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000030:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214fdcccde98d0a62775f2877532a682dd0c57a52cd14611dc528e8ff823d3ea",
      "text": "软弱与逞强都要同行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee956ba013cb0a3dbf667858c3b79fe89cae462454956276f6ce305943b9deac",
      "text": "“诶……旅途中的哥哥寄来的信？\n好久不见了，真开心啊！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c128446b99f8d441019347a9c1de22e93ee66af9b930a848caedcc46be5299e",
      "text": "花音君。我们的角色是“过去的王子”，\n所以动作如果能更加留心一点，效果会更好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c30a5657aa9ad397a8dfb5bfb9862c3f641ad6d2900d35f1d6214f4815c2e212",
      "text": "啊，对哦～。走路和奔跑的方式也得注意才行\n呢。那么，嗯——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f2490148b35a819a94e57918ebf7f2c958f93031c369aea3b8e5b804834d611",
      "text": "我说，●●●●プロデューサー。\n这次的演技部门，大家用的都是同一份剧本对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5193a3fba6f7abf96a45cd788e812d6b2d1c1c2554d7d870596c6b1050d5ad8a",
      "text": "是的。其他参赛组合，\n也会在当天的节目中表演和大家完全相同的剧本与角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd9f1bf3e2b4a095de8fa5810e5f24fea1d40bbf149ccfc2b73245700964a01",
      "text": "所有人条件一致，也没有戏服和妆造。\n希望大家只凭纯粹的演技来一决胜负。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df4a8acd4a018491b91d1f39fdb07d1185a9194369c53213676c415b6b30e9e6",
      "text": "扑～。花音想穿王子的衣服嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a706f7ef51138254cba32eb616ef4d6b2854a74509159da61bf00001f06ffb23",
      "text": "要是能准备可爱的王子衣服，\n花音肯定还能更——加努力的嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee056edca6b02a3ab90fa71e648fca5a0fe64f1a181aeb00886f47a6b800367",
      "text": "呵呵。就算没有衣服，\n我们也要努力演得像王子一样哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f12d96d2a546e02b039d097325f5f51c80ea56ac87ebab1a527f5c08ef91cd32",
      "text": "没那回事，已经完全演得很像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3eaeb1adbc42aa5a3a7cc32b0b8c3ae50686ae8c54df991ba793083e452378",
      "text": "能从正在表演的三个人身上，感受到王子的高雅气质呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69457839aaf9159196bcb8eca9128b6802bd9a0678d27b178df983e64aceea97",
      "text": "很厉害呢。\n光是在一起，就全是值得学习的地方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc875feb979bd545a9891fb5b11caa238e4fd4b17b0e4e2ad51a5911a314223e",
      "text": "对我们而言，三位是业界的资深前辈。\n这次的联合课程，想必会成为宝贵的经验吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef4a259e6cd0e6cc7db4da20fb942f836678aa2554ddfe45be53b0f0fd6acb7",
      "text": "锐心你太谦虚啦——。\n真是的，这样一点挑战的意义都没有嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf8465e51cea2469e0179c593944ca4969cd07d39756f18e0a6e6600680c647",
      "text": "我们明明是同一家事务所的伙伴兼对手吧。\n别在乎那些细节，尽管放马过来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afa5b23d627307237cb879d5b0fde0c8647ebf1cb26d7ba9fee4949e1e940f06",
      "text": "而且，大家是比我们\n年长的高中生前辈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:093310d494b4f5b91c2885d700871ad3a27d8a3285c57402d175e06cbd24eb24",
      "text": "前辈啊～。\n315 Production里，有各种各样的前辈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bfa2f9d65e7d3f1e32bcf3c5f20633554252f4f25be9cb841d59c6c6f17509a",
      "text": "类老师是英语超——厉害的前辈吧。\n翼君和圭君，是软绵绵的前辈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2717e304f2733469d3694a81c33adcd465dbb975385da0a4fbdaa44b5b3d7626",
      "text": "诚司先生和道流先生是肌肉猛男前辈……\n啊！次郎老师是邋里邋遢的前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24d7657e4f5a9c3b13cfdf9684e42082059701b84d0d1fd25aae3f2dd3aeb6e",
      "text": "花、花音君！\n呃，确实有很多前辈在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf948eb2ed4453e1e3fe5ae2e97b2db64ca9bf3163d097ab2305d14f4edf71e",
      "text": "嗯！大家都既温柔又有趣，花音最喜欢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a7e12b3f00ee3be13de007ebde135795268595ab7f5e6d0c90cdc8225a637ed",
      "text": "呐呐，秀你们上的高中，\n是个什么样的地方啊？告诉我嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bf002a520c7898c3c3c47184db543d45015d327eb2e5d115f58766d8a423bc2",
      "text": "这个嘛……比起小学和初中，\n感觉是个做更专业学习的地方吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a3235be52a2fa8eadcd097dd2d9b5537e399d05012e48ef019282237449f7b5",
      "text": "文化节和运动会这类学校活动，\n规模也很大，气氛超级热闹的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b42da6dbb10fc9d997bd5763694ebf13f49c216ae19f77a02e15981a14435516",
      "text": "好厉害——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa679b38efc785e6414681a5c04998a0fa972e66d31a1821a14e24f3c59cee7a",
      "text": "高中生明明很忙，\n三个人却都还担任着学生会长呢。真厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc8cb569affd4b129f1b0d08e6f34de14ac3316fcb7407c87f5e66c39ab53753",
      "text": "嘛，毕竟年龄长了，头脑和身体也都成长了。\n不算什么大不了的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d88bff850a7dfa34c6fac525e4c680434127ad85554b3e6084e58bb28ba4e79",
      "text": "秀，你倒是挺得意洋洋的啊。\n你直到不久前为止都还是个初中生吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09d6d79c28d913c3a2408110bb99e2333d7003de66639f5beb0cde4d868bc1",
      "text": "天峰君是刚出壳的雏鸟高中生呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd6db0fa50c17377fd9ed2f62879a346ac81bc83fdc6a8945654af3fa28950f4",
      "text": "初中生，就是小学生升上去之后的那个吧？\n那秀不是跟我们差不多嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77afb1e4696bd5b9cd3fcd75737b2209243ac64f685fff976ebabc5c40835a55",
      "text": "才、才不一样！\n小学生和初中生完全是两码事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09855fd95bdd755680290f016ce7b4e96e604de45b2d813265a550415b6ef369",
      "text": "到了高中生，\n差距还会变得更大呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1deda19d59572a72957c83e07f43d4609ac2497065862ba817e152f08970c81",
      "text": "……呵呵，也不用这么强调差距吧。\n在C.FIRST里，你毫无疑问是年纪最小的那个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ebf31fb2365c0e15e5e0b93cd855218da5768302b5e5a09ffb2147d6a02ef38",
      "text": "请别找麻烦逗我了……\n看，指导老师在叫我们了。走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a989dd767703900a51c1c1b5e896b45a9ddccfbb98f471d2c685862faad7df6",
      "text": "练习结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4db090c1793b260f70caf0847513d45d33578917124c1200a8d48a3abb9ffc1",
      "text": "もふもふえん的各位，\n一整天都活力充沛呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e45c8c6f98899c9e6fdfeac5442ce578c8e61f8f331029f5bad22f7e68321f9",
      "text": "哈啊，感觉被折腾得够呛……\n小孩子的体力还真是有富余呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f969912a73b5bc9754bfc1a14d46ac6dd3846300bfb5f79a89126c3aa78a02c",
      "text": "……不过，如果我家有个弟弟的话……\n我家里每天也会那么热闹吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7f1687e0a6d3c638705d8c7349eb220540587655d3b28a88e5c1390674f47c",
      "text": "虽然会很累，\n但那样说不定也挺开心的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da3fd37ff20095aea309a89863f98698fd6c25664ef3c382461762fd629e085d",
      "text": "……是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29f18fa8044f48dc6219e8e81241688634faa494874a248228870b4c38369e71",
      "text": "哎，姬野君发LINK过来了。\n有什么事呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29683a6f70020106b3e50db37b4320a3849ac4a4387f8bbaca4cd7769138e557",
      "text": "怎么了，百百人。有什么顾虑吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7717527bd5e1022c1bde9ee7185cb83a68e19c457d70a3e2edb608202d6317e",
      "text": "……诶嘿嘿。其实我，\n面对年纪小的孩子会有点紧张。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ac79843f183bcc35b34aa6290e6c291c6853000e44ada524160339f45541746",
      "text": "因为不知道他们会突然说什么，\n所以也不知道该怎么做准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cb400516456c2a05ee8a50b1aae00168840fd47401122b6236895e4206fffca",
      "text": "虽说在今天的练习里和三个人稍微拉近了关系，\n但是……直接通电话还是会心跳加速呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000119:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea82c6cf4ccc0520ef6de96c0f2c08b973645c3502c325c31aaca9f007256c2",
      "text": "呐呐，●●●●プロデューサー！\n你看过LINK上的自我介绍了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000121:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:675d270a1b5392ee939714d522ffc9d9e82a4b0a368685ae2faeeffff33701d8",
      "text": "花音用的是最喜欢的小兔子表情符号哦。\n然后呢，百百人君也用的是一样的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:618df6af7a8399873c85aa30a863360d04c540f20b55d58b4ea429e56084fdef",
      "text": "所以花音就跟百百人君拜托，\n希望能和他成为小兔子朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c0878d4966875aa4d5746755a546f779ad7bee740cf7662a10653172ed1081e",
      "text": "然后百百人君就带着小兔子表情，\n回复我说“请多关照”了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641d2b626651e9ebf914a092b51c77c540fd02870efa75a7e009815c2e3940d6",
      "text": "而且而且，他还发了好多\n可爱的小鸡贴图给我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43b633b1d3ea6d9a93620cb1381c74c6691a187cb9abebec7006229c03e6c531",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……能和百百人君\n变得更要好就太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000131:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:979ef0dbde5e4250f2f9527ea709ae78894e3662063d914ae32e81592a3827ba",
      "text": "一定可以的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c526a7d11a2abe6b10766de9a854c69903c5de6667128c2bc510fac2f86decb",
      "text": "嗯！要变得越来越要好，\n小兔子和小鸡要一起玩耍♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000135:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28eb0e4f8302ce0d85dff69b8ae91a1cd225ed45ce9ef210f82da28cd70bf604",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你听花音\n说话。拜拜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd56bcc5e230e56f738b447d20209e0cc2bfd5338be73331ea4fb5d1aa10df0",
      "text": "诶诶，剧本又改了！？\n明明离正式演出没剩多少时间了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea5c49aaef9dad681e9002c0ca903b5a972c70873d62496f72261e89c27392dd",
      "text": "大家一起练习过的王子角色……\n感觉性格也变得完全不一样了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93946a87abc11c232f4a7aa8fc65fa9efb1bc2431f39e4975c47b8022479f793",
      "text": "而且剧本改动，这已经是第三次了吧。\n为什么会这样呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13d431152670b6056edfd7ec8211c036d15eece6b7476845aa48f96db362684f",
      "text": "抱歉。我也没能问到详细的理由。\n只是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ee81851455ca6ca01704a17f1df2b89b038b4dca083f353f1029c014903dc1b",
      "text": "这份是新的剧本。\n再三修改，真的非常抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:302f80c02c10f378af3e0bd0b0e49f2368593e5bba25ed298ab88a71471c4dd1",
      "text": "不……但是，能不能请您告诉我\n反复修改的理由呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8aedcf8bc6fa3284e14335de82d3fd11caf077664015c56f43f48a28d1cdad7",
      "text": "其实……最近完全看不到男极主办者的身影。\n偶尔会有工作指示通过邮件发过来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:555333394b67ee55ba9096bd20860dfeb867da6dc9d67840b8bbd8964f1c5a60",
      "text": "但内容含糊不清，我们也是在混乱之中，\n勉强支撑着大会的运营……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91cfc8104224d3e69fc80e2139d7c92342d8cc1891b016808963ba01d9b68ba8",
      "text": "（至今为止，这比赛确实有很多可疑之处。但是，\n甚至存在大赛本身被取消的可能吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38bfa5ea88e903f9e1989ef25ea38a2ba8d21bf222ca4060410f0da726dbc131",
      "text": "亏我们还特意和秀君他们\n一起做了练习呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29e324d749e4b92e195a3dfdc589dbe43e04701a47492dfa8f39e50a10cc8cee",
      "text": "唉——，又要从头再来一遍吗——。\n……话说干脆弃权不演也可以吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea08d01bdd9630c078b8222af9b3812255ff1852a9194c56245dc0136def692",
      "text": "志狼君、花音君。\n虽然很遗憾，但接下的工作还是竭尽全力去完成吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d46c4970eb3114b3adf219753cd391d96033c54a82853dcd77ddd3df9b6e2c9f",
      "text": "练习的时间虽然不多，\n正式演出时或许不会太顺利……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637b32a1e6c72ddf695b6edc4681e79880d7b7bcd71d120d155ad03bea7da3ff",
      "text": "但315 Production的大家，\n为了这次比赛一直努力到了现在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:030459733a097a8866882c22099e981b0ec6217a6530bb2bbb059c27ae6ba2d6",
      "text": "もふもふえん也要为了315 Pro、\n还有粉丝大家一起努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f8f460abb252f8fed3002aa2d788479f091c6e17938e6f80957e5328fc83c1f",
      "text": "直央……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abefaa3f9b092f83d3b2ec0bd280a7608b5e6af6a43e296163af96a1d41352d6",
      "text": "也是呢。因为还有人给我们发消息说，\n“好期待もふもふえん的表演！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c60613acc1de038d22e0246ef6ce6a089317b7f74a5dfce66411af296d0a7857",
      "text": "要是听说我们不演了，一定会很失望的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cd82029edcc807d8e7a69545861e934ea9afc8791de1cdc7b7113064acdfa04",
      "text": "但是啊……要是演得不好\n让人家失望了怎么办啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61dd69aaf735c8b745d3d4d7d74214d654a9ccc8ff8902009e749fcfaf847626",
      "text": "到那时候，下一次，\n我们315 Production大家再一起努力就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ebdee0aaf3af1ea7372bf346c1c7f2d5eaeb44348a40d074e64e538d1d4a372",
      "text": "只要全员齐心协力，无论发生什么都能克服的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a03d81e481e1a9e45e9fd61ad6eb4eda08e22d74ec5d979cee67e01159117683",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n说得也是啊。是我太泄气了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a8a3074b57e47778c8b5a0d59a60444abc435e21b9f72cb4ec5bfa747ffa1a4",
      "text": "我们这边，可是有超级多的同伴呢。\n这点小事，根本不算什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000126:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000133:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01128a88011d56529bac4398ca8297fa84821424717cbeb6fc2ba08330c5d7df",
      "text": "练习休息的时候\n聊到的那件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000135:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f82ada0cb896f9d7f328b5766ab0acec8dfb7d9939ce05551e4d4fe61ec0eb",
      "text": "两个人同时说的台词，\n我觉得还是卡好节奏配合一下\n会比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000137:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecd1c21d2b251074d24daa27de4e03c5202d048e2d482dcca5ffff457ac3cb2c",
      "text": "我也这么觉得！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000139:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33af22f796488ba82d2faaa5f4731ba10135c7c03a8764c5aa9fd7ad366ea6a7",
      "text": "我们的角色虽然\n性格各不相同，\n但毕竟是兄弟对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000141:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:285c1e0faf6f7d8371d0fc245ca488944abe0f3aa3077fab38097c88c527af5d",
      "text": "既然是兄弟的话\n节奏完全一致才对嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000143:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:252d28c5c0375f3b1e3105dda50234c85091eb7a093f5bc46cd0068cf7e59653",
      "text": "花音也赞成！\n明天的练习时\n大家一起试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19262032b6645f7cc3965ebe928265006c03e4359472d0de7f0c38ec3cad434b",
      "text": "制作人也是，\n要是有什么注意到的地方\n请告诉我们哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000147:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e",
      "text": "好的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000147:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646566900ce2533b9b579f724d2d523dc0c83f55d40a3ad3663ef3f4acdd1b4c",
      "text": "好的。\n我会再仔细\n看看视频的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000148:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e224e5ff9f4911779e873714c0298e26c9ee244edb0a9a7a69d762a5d9a9631",
      "text": "交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000148:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11f5a6111c532cd280458bc903605c11dd01723d7fab480b4502b754f9ab2024",
      "text": "交给我吧！\n明天也请多多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000152:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c92699d340911a92e1ad8632d1dd6b15c3ee19a31cae3b601bb48d73c82c5037",
      "text": "谢谢！\n那么，明天见啦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000154:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32cc2b0dc1ad5cf4aba5473fb1b4f4e18de52770c6de2e61bd9bf3cb245c930b",
      "text": "我说啊，直央",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000156:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:899828233503335e2e3cf2cd07bbd13bb5d909474a78109ccce8ccf54ef1f995",
      "text": "今天稍微\n有点帅气呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000158:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce4a94c513d25ae846c5b4c2dcca7bea4f0f7eeaa65833efe5660eefcb27004b",
      "text": "就这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0438f25d0869dad62d8bb5fa77d2cb8c563524aee003394ec651f763470f10b",
      "text": "唔——，接下来，\n记得是在练习室……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fcd7dfaa47dd222b1ac42b275430b9f17a172139507c27e0a25361da998f28",
      "text": "好久不见了！男极的工作人员\n最近一直在叹气说都见不到您呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84c1ddf02f75a936082f53849f7a2d6f98ce6f71cd7ab8bde7def7d7865cadea",
      "text": "毕竟您既要主办男极，又要兼顾平时的工作，\n确实是很忙碌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6534db3641abc2bab7b4b6ea8afdcb131778659f9e3213c689bc39ac5220757a",
      "text": "是啊……真的很忙啊。本来\n像这样停下脚步的时间都是没有的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71382d4598669670b090bc95da6c3fb798bf1e0bfbff5c2501d73862462c6ac2",
      "text": "对、对不起呢。冒昧跟您搭话，\n实在抱歉……那先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:318f15a763311c1eaad29dbecd1664d53e64a8bd174e9977d766404361d80101",
      "text": "（嘿——。那个人就是男极的大人物啊！\n不过，看起来像个坏心眼的家伙呢——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4337bd0e3e18b748bccf5d05e0c0c5dc8242b5350b42946cc8de0f8bd208c85a",
      "text": "可恶，什么男极啊。不管怎么从中作梗，\n弱小事务所每次都那么神气……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e77e27dceefa7fa3fda5382f529e322cbe67822c7230022ea7af1e82e95e704c",
      "text": "托他们的福，我们自己的事务所完全没出上风头\n不是吗！这样搞下去简直成了彻底的失败企划。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85d71f6a41c9ca2633db537ae81022e93944af1a41e12d50e5b09d452c92d43e",
      "text": "之后会发生什么也说不准。\n总之我得先把退路准备好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce27d01c2622accb31ac8494df52ebf9728edfeea47b4d2c9311d412e7e8eea2",
      "text": "（……！什么嘛，那种话……\n大家为了这次比赛都在拼命努力啊。不可饶恕！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f313c5f2ef56d1060d86666262847ebd94f1059ba4fd6795ea7180a816ec15",
      "text": "喂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab29481a24e06bfc09df0e3343f6a66b9f0348ede6e9f45be2db3f03a4e49b2",
      "text": "嗯？你是……哪来的小鬼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7f13995bebfe522c9144e7d8cdd86377faca9afda7d584bb5376ffecf4062d0",
      "text": "你这家伙……临阵脱逃也太逊了吧！\n堂堂正正地来跟我们决胜负啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ae93084bc4ab133a3c56bffa0c108d2b791f710e5ac2263ebb40bcb70131d9",
      "text": "穿着西装，摆着吓人的脸色让周围的人害怕。\n也许你确实是个超级了不起的大人物吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc2b0319b99e18e8ca5f1aad0cba87a0d1d7650157869644627bf3f4e3b462b",
      "text": "但明知道可能做不好，\n却依然坚持去做的我们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed276eb06d17a59a551e49f1f6241b97c4f14de4abab2baa53ef23ec32878206",
      "text": "说了要努力的直央，比起你这种家伙，\n可要强大几百倍帅气几百倍！所以……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf194457c2569331d42425e4b980c2514e6acaf26c14566c4737a59e25018782",
      "text": "你，难道是315 Production的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdd5edb7153d092634bf943df383bcc98618bb0c3946f39fc2bf7f74a35f6eca",
      "text": "志狼君，发生什么事了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f5a27d3bc078e67a840d9fe515600f5c6985457152c0e390941407d646eeb8c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！花音、直央……\n呜……连、连工作人员也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee671847c244f5b4472e4c6a1478ec606ca78916bf76e6f44174e9e50150c92",
      "text": "我……呜。对不起，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我太生气了，忍不住吼了出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5e8310e4f45add2ce6fcb12d7ddd2b5c76d877e02d1deaa1a069ef38277ddc0",
      "text": "没事的，志狼君。没事的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a778f2ae1e0e8a73db4b05a8cfc593569c762059b2b4c87117ea9260dd0b4dd",
      "text": "那个……关于男极的事情，目前有几项在等待主办方的\n答复，请问该如何处理……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72e54a9d74db0648b99d6d3b2a24c84e907623271ea8722b00b9ee3b231b1c4f",
      "text": "啧，我哪知道，别什么事都来向我请示！\n你们工作人员自己拿主意不就行了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9efc89620ef69ab3fc4832192273a7e8b02f5e0883e44776c3a50335dbafc46a",
      "text": "可、可是，如果负责人不定下来的话，\n大家心里都没底，工作根本无法推进啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0a045b30d579b5dd7abbdb538406479bd56d2fad7a1b14bc866676f52a92cc",
      "text": "那就让偶像负责。去台前\n抛头露面的是偶像吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5db2abbc1dd94bc9f6aca46e196ee6e5fa8a498d7b4cad37b0acc74608b20a8",
      "text": "请、请等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39f37a983ae51b0417627abe580f1c0e6064da8c5a2ebb844b1e16028896c71d",
      "text": "那个……我也一样。\n对于重大的工作和责任，我非常不擅长，也很害怕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:109013c6437962e587084081b49d8773b731f1a1bb499dacb6f1cbfbb49ebd58",
      "text": "但是，能够给予像我这样的人力量的，\n我认为正是偶像。所、所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702bb051594d41eb714451bea54a972e71ccc5f0f1d80bca2b28ae8d7824e31f",
      "text": "我们，不仅会为主办方加油，也会为全体工作人员加油！\n……大家一起，把大会办下去好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ccc3e173f0472b7f9286c162505f36d335e0a96218c4e98301f77fd704c028",
      "text": "就是呀，感到害怕的话，有花音我们在呀！\n搞砸了的时候我们也在呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5577f11da9db5d0e1917e527ef26a31e23435958b237a31b0630dfbdbc69b3c0",
      "text": "只要和大家在一起，无论何时都能努力坚持下去的哦。\n对吧，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d738ab459133dec6474f364d0c9a77532c2555d6c928f1d18ed5bfaa6bee9d1",
      "text": "是啊。……要不要再一起把男极办下去呢？\n多亏了男极，315 Pro才能更进一步地成长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:560e1d63ece47d4b10a04e5116409e1ba76799eae5466e1793e179f9d02ca73d",
      "text": "每经历一场战斗就变得越发高大的偶像们的身姿，\n想必您也是看在眼里的。这份力量，直到最后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cea021ed2d694f5fa51f331251c7c9a3d4b079c9ad1473629e8cea957dbb2e8",
      "text": "…………哼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dab41f44f090e689c93b39a62157dd9538d089a5a1b3f080772e5ac2303347f",
      "text": "啊！……走了。\n话才说到一半居然就直接走掉了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6447d4c29d43066d34579990a5397246abf1a7d2e9d9e21f0034eb3fb22d24c",
      "text": "……他或许是不相信偶像的力量……\n又或许，只是遗忘了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ffdc6f6854fd7aa7810a952b24854cfa8bc775a1319fd36019660e9360b9be2",
      "text": "……既然这样，就由我们来帮他想起来吧。\n在节目当天，展现出超绝帅气的演技给他看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1a080620c51def78555ad493f0d04e82fb3b72e0c75019bffa1f5dc043a02b5",
      "text": "毕竟，看到帅气的东西时，\n觉得帅气的心情是压抑不住的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a55908c45c1f1517d10fdbe746a69360041a3fe42e02110f5fe2fcaeec1909ad",
      "text": "志狼君。也要让他看到可爱的一面才行哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4ba53ec3215d9e20909c01305c66fa5972215316bff4c68649c43e989993553",
      "text": "もふもふえん可是既帅气又可爱、\n值得依靠的闪闪发光的组合呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c126ac79dfd9e5a96866cc171677e33438d1b6e4c382212b74a4e601b8e54368",
      "text": "节目当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d971f33dc0f3cf2067bc5231510ea500ccfcf4c7f007afdb55492d0769b864",
      "text": "“由我来当新王？\n为什么……那原本应该是哥哥的梦想才对啊。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813f585ee4574f8111a1dee0662fd7a3d668ccf59d5306f05652cd839186766d",
      "text": "“不。我只是被唆使着去怀抱那个梦想罢了。\n……多亏了你，我才意识到了自己真正的心意。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74015dba123b1e24787a590d434339c519a236d0b295849d3d3999c270f0c12",
      "text": "“从今往后，作为王，也是我深爱的弟弟，\n我会一直支持你。这才是我的新梦想。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68ff60353ca539293dd13edb0d28999ec5f3c165774c9a8a53b22fe29f259ca9",
      "text": "“……唉，看来只能放弃出走了。毕竟体弱多病的你，\n加上古板的哥哥，还不知道会出什么乱子呢。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2dedb2575a9c1586cde2357bd9207024a27ebbaac9e8123504b4f6358da8a49",
      "text": "“我也留在这个国家。暂时可以依靠我一把哦。\n虽说守规矩那一套我可不在行。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3df246399da63b73104870f8741ef11a797da2afe7cff18af258f5f5fd5c8265",
      "text": "“谢谢你们……我一定会，\n成为一个能让大家引以为傲的国王。我保证！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24253bff0f85713c18894caa1dda0c8875961eef26d043358d2dd3f78a1b6b1f",
      "text": "卡——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f25dea80e4ed2b845d1f9be2220850b96b58ea7d05d03ebeb5ecf9ac8ef7508",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n怎么样？刚才超帅的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae3a5c289093357cb5d75ed0b46e06dd48174d2218c6faccbea451a6a28d2ae2",
      "text": "嗯，非常帅气哦。\n大家的演技都很逼真传神！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ef8b3095b79f241b32c29af2f9f6fe07a1ef009fd3a74b8e776c84f4457c3a8",
      "text": "呼……刚才还忐忑会不会搞砸呢，\n但最后彻底沉浸进去了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f85541a649b28bd175cfecccc909321b7130bb9f7792a946b8c661aa74d6b2bf",
      "text": "而且，超级开心的呢。虽然也有过很多辛苦的事，\n但花音能和大家一起出场太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ceaf56e30bcbb2b0ff60c157f570205bdbc125c3f751a754b5ca76070c7295",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……我也是。果然もふもふえん是个\n很厉害的组合，让我有了自信……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70ca70d24d04346c06f7425d982c70e03565d0d6c83e984e8ca3c683023528a",
      "text": "哎哎，现在才反应过来吗！？直央你真是的，\n到底是胆小还是有骨气啊，真搞不懂你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8d6d0a3c48d3982257325aad4190e5bfc739a6996f3022f2bde0e3724da2815",
      "text": "啊，呃，我是说重新感受到了啦……！\n呜呜，抱歉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25b0af926446e40debeb909dc87453cd192ea330bf758a07b2ac9bdf01133993",
      "text": "嘛，这不挺好的嘛？今天啊，\n演戏时的直央……真不愧是你，魄力十足呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2678d1cee2178d4461002664b287d7f53a6de67f909f2d2943bbb646089c7207",
      "text": "我们もふもふえん的力量，\n绝对已经传达给看过的每一个人了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
